IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHP0015.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    05 DANGER-GOODS-IND   PIC X.
    05 SERVICE-CD         PIC X.
    05 SHIP-DISTANCE      PIC 9(5).
    05 POST-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 POST-DATE-R REDEFINES POST-DATE.
       10 POST-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 POST-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 POST-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 SHIP-BLOCK         PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 SURCHG-AMT         PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 4000-HAZMAT
    DISPLAY "SHIP-BLOCK=" SHIP-BLOCK
    DISPLAY "SURCHG-AMT=" SURCHG-AMT
    STOP RUN.
4000-HAZMAT.
    IF DANGER-GOODS-IND = 'Y'
        IF SERVICE-CD = 'O'
            MOVE 'Y' TO SHIP-BLOCK
        ELSE IF SHIP-DISTANCE > 1000
            MOVE 60 TO SURCHG-AMT
        ELSE
            MOVE 25 TO SURCHG-AMT
        END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
